      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Picked up SOTM from Orc's Nest in London a couple of weeks ago.&nbsp;</p><p>Hats off to the design team for a cracking job. Great gameplay which absolutely nails the theme. Thus far I have only played solo. Very much looking forward to multiplayer.</p><p>Four session reports up on Board Game Geek.</p><p>Regards,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fentum</p>",
