      "created_at": "2012-12-02T08:18:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ameena,</p><p>It's a regular board games club. Most of the time we meet on Monday (which I can't make), Tuesday and Wednesday, but the Christmas party bookings really mess up our schedule. It's called London On Board and you can find details on the www.meetup.com website under that name. We play a lot of different board games, but I'm almost always up for a game of Sentinels.</p><p>The pub is near St Paul's, not too far away from Bank, Liverpool Street or Moorgate underground, if that helps orient you.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:21:04.929Z",
