    {
      "id": 47607,
      "name": "Mezike",
      "username": "Mezike",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-02T17:37:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can second London On Board as a great place to game, I think there are also Sunday sessions in St. James and the occasional weekend retreat in Eastbourne. there is often quite a broad range of games being played so it is quite accommodating. I'm usually in Isleworth on a Wednesday as it is more local for me, there are a few of us there who enjoy sotm so it's not difficult to get a game going.</p>",
