      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I can second London On Board as a great place to game, I think there are also Sunday sessions in St. James and the occasional weekend retreat in Eastbourne. there is often quite a broad range of games being played so it is quite accommodating. I&#39;m usually in Isleworth on a Wednesday as it is more local for me, there are a few of us there who enjoy sotm so it&#39;s not difficult to get a game going.</p>",
