      "username": "Fentum",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b3f665/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-12-02T18:02:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"pwatson1974\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/48/1925_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> pwatson1974:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fentum,If you'd prefer a face to face game or two in London, pop along to a London on Board meeting. They're held at the Red Herring on Gresham Street most weeks. There's one this Tuesday (4th December). I'm always up for a game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks for the heads up. I have heard of London on board, but I never seem to get my schedule sorted. I am about an hour north in general. I'll have to pop over next time I'm in on business. If a dapper gent brings in SOTM, do you believe he'll get a game going?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>PS The Red Herring. What a cracking name for a pub to play games in.</p>",
