      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Check out the Events forum.&nbsp; There should be a pinned topic about Skype meetups if you need a ready-made group that is familiar with the rules.&nbsp; Welcome to the forums and the Multiverse!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Skype and Google plus link ups? Holy cow Wraith! That sounds ideal.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I play wargames via Vassal using Skype, and enjoy it.</p>\n<p>How do I get into SOTM ON LINE?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
